{"authored" [] "sources" [{"question" "q-49677" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Evaluate the integral  ${\\int }_{0}^{1/2}x{e}^{2x}\\,\\text{d}x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031626/state.json" "file_sha256" "b044ff58ae98c114d47f0e472cfd823b5642a7c1ef80f958de299959df55c3ca"} {"question" "q-49677" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let's use integration by parts. We set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=x & ⇒ & {u}^{′}=1 \\\\ {v}^{′}={e}^{2x} & ⇒ & v=\\frac{{e}^{2x}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the integration by parts formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int x\\cdot {e}^{2x}\\,\\text{d}x & =x\\cdot \\frac{{e}^{2x}}{2}-\\int \\frac{{e}^{2x}}{2}\\cdot 1\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we evaluate the integral and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1/2}x{e}^{2x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{2}(x{e}^{2x}){|}_{0}^{1/2}-\\frac{1}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{1/2}{e}^{2x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(x{e}^{2x}){|}_{0}^{1/2}-\\frac{{e}^{2x}}{4}{|}_{0}^{1/2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}[\\frac{1}{2}{e}^{2(1/2)}-0\\cdot {e}^{2\\cdot 0}]-\\frac{1}{4}[{e}^{2(1/2)}-{e}^{2\\cdot 0}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}[\\frac{e}{2}-0]-\\frac{1}{4}[e-1] \\\\  & =\\frac{e}{4}-\\frac{e-1}{4} \\\\  & =\\frac{e-e+1}{4} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031626/state.json" "file_sha256" "b044ff58ae98c114d47f0e472cfd823b5642a7c1ef80f958de299959df55c3ca"} {"question" "q-49677" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031626/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "640ecc0f815d7582c1b911b92d4daaa1f3b664c6db18b53fa8ca347a8dcad340"} {"question" "q-49677" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031626/state.json" "file_sha256" "b044ff58ae98c114d47f0e472cfd823b5642a7c1ef80f958de299959df55c3ca"} {"question" "q-49677" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "\\frac{1}{2}"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{4}"] ["math" "\\frac{e+1}{4}"] ["math" "\\frac{e}{2}+1"] ["math" "\\frac{e}{4}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031626/state.json" "file_sha256" "b044ff58ae98c114d47f0e472cfd823b5642a7c1ef80f958de299959df55c3ca"} {"question" "q-49677" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{1}{4}"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031626/state.json" "file_sha256" "b044ff58ae98c114d47f0e472cfd823b5642a7c1ef80f958de299959df55c3ca"} {"question" "q-49682" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Evaluate ${\\int }_{\\pi /2}^{3\\pi /2}2x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031626/state.json" "file_sha256" "b044ff58ae98c114d47f0e472cfd823b5642a7c1ef80f958de299959df55c3ca"} {"question" "q-49682" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let's use integration by parts. We set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=2x & ⇒ & {u}^{′}=2 \\\\ {v}^{′}=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x) & ⇒ & v=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the integration by parts formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int 2x\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =2x\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)-\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)\\cdot 2\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we evaluate the integral and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{\\pi /2}^{3\\pi /2}2x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =2x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x){|}_{\\pi /2}^{3\\pi /2}-{\\int }_{\\pi /2}^{3\\pi /2}2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x){|}_{\\pi /2}^{3\\pi /2}+2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x){|}_{\\pi /2}^{3\\pi /2} \\\\  & =2[\\frac{3\\pi }{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{3\\pi }{2})-\\frac{\\pi }{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})] \\\\  & +2[\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{3\\pi }{2})-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})] \\\\  & =2[-\\frac{3\\pi }{2}-\\frac{\\pi }{2}]+2[0-0] \\\\  & =2(-2\\pi )+0 \\\\  & =-4\\pi .\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031626/state.json" "file_sha256" "b044ff58ae98c114d47f0e472cfd823b5642a7c1ef80f958de299959df55c3ca"} {"question" "q-49682" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031626/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "640ecc0f815d7582c1b911b92d4daaa1f3b664c6db18b53fa8ca347a8dcad340"} {"question" "q-49682" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031626/state.json" "file_sha256" "b044ff58ae98c114d47f0e472cfd823b5642a7c1ef80f958de299959df55c3ca"} {"question" "q-49682" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-4\\pi "] ["math" "-\\frac{\\pi }{4}"] ["math" "-\\pi "] ["math" "2\\pi "] ["math" "\\frac{\\pi }{2}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031626/state.json" "file_sha256" "b044ff58ae98c114d47f0e472cfd823b5642a7c1ef80f958de299959df55c3ca"} {"question" "q-49682" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-4\\pi "] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031626/state.json" "file_sha256" "b044ff58ae98c114d47f0e472cfd823b5642a7c1ef80f958de299959df55c3ca"} {"question" "q-74087" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate  $\\int 2x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x+8)\\text{d}x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031626/state.json" "file_sha256" "b044ff58ae98c114d47f0e472cfd823b5642a7c1ef80f958de299959df55c3ca"} {"question" "q-74087" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To solve this integral, we use the by-parts formula, given by\n\n$$\n\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x=uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe need to express $\\int 2x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x+8)\\text{d}x$ as $\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.$ Therefore, we set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=2x\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=2 \\\\ {v}^{′}=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x+8)\\, & ⟹\\,v=\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x+8)}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe substitute the above into the integration by parts formula, and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int 2x\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x+8)\\,\\text{d}x & =2x\\cdot \\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x+8)}{2}-\\int \\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x+8)}{2}\\cdot 2\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we calculate the integral, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 2x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x+8)\\text{d}x & =x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x+8)-\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x+8)\\text{d}x \\\\  & =x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x+8)+\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x+8)}{2}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031626/state.json" "file_sha256" "b044ff58ae98c114d47f0e472cfd823b5642a7c1ef80f958de299959df55c3ca"} {"question" "q-74087" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031626/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "640ecc0f815d7582c1b911b92d4daaa1f3b664c6db18b53fa8ca347a8dcad340"} {"question" "q-74087" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031626/state.json" "file_sha256" "b044ff58ae98c114d47f0e472cfd823b5642a7c1ef80f958de299959df55c3ca"} {"question" "q-74087" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "2x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x+8)+\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x+8)}{2}+C"] ["math" "2x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x+8)+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x+8)+C"] ["math" "2x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x+8)-\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x+8)}{4}+C"] ["math" "x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x+8)+\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x+8)}{2}+C"] ["math" "x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x+8)-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x+8)+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031626/state.json" "file_sha256" "b044ff58ae98c114d47f0e472cfd823b5642a7c1ef80f958de299959df55c3ca"} {"question" "q-74087" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x+8)+\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x+8)}{2}+C"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031626/state.json" "file_sha256" "b044ff58ae98c114d47f0e472cfd823b5642a7c1ef80f958de299959df55c3ca"} {"question" "q-74088" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "$\\int (6x+1)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031626/state.json" "file_sha256" "b044ff58ae98c114d47f0e472cfd823b5642a7c1ef80f958de299959df55c3ca"} {"question" "q-74088" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To solve this integral, we use the by-parts formula, given by\n\n$$\n\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x=uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe need to express $\\int (6x+1)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)\\text{d}x$ as $\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.$ Therefore, we set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=6x+1\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=6 \\\\ {v}^{′}=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)\\, & ⟹\\,v=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe substitute the above into the integration by parts formula, and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int (6x+1)\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =(6x+1)\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)-\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)\\cdot 6\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we calculate the integral, as follows\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (6x+1)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)\\text{d}x & =(6x+1)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)-6\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =(6x+1)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)+6\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031626/state.json" "file_sha256" "b044ff58ae98c114d47f0e472cfd823b5642a7c1ef80f958de299959df55c3ca"} {"question" "q-74088" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031626/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "640ecc0f815d7582c1b911b92d4daaa1f3b664c6db18b53fa8ca347a8dcad340"} {"question" "q-74088" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031626/state.json" "file_sha256" "b044ff58ae98c114d47f0e472cfd823b5642a7c1ef80f958de299959df55c3ca"} {"question" "q-74088" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "(6x+1)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)+6\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)+C"] ["math" "(6x+1)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)+\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)}{6}+C"] ["math" "6\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)+6\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)+C"] ["math" "\\frac{(6x+1)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)}{6}+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)+C"] ["math" "\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031626/state.json" "file_sha256" "b044ff58ae98c114d47f0e472cfd823b5642a7c1ef80f958de299959df55c3ca"} {"question" "q-74088" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "(6x+1)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)+6\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)+C"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031626/state.json" "file_sha256" "b044ff58ae98c114d47f0e472cfd823b5642a7c1ef80f958de299959df55c3ca"} {"question" "q-349231" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{0}^{1}4x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi x)\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031626/state.json" "file_sha256" "b044ff58ae98c114d47f0e472cfd823b5642a7c1ef80f958de299959df55c3ca"} {"question" "q-349231" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let's use integration by parts. We set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=4x & ⇒ & {u}^{′}=4 \\\\ {v}^{′}=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi x) & ⇒ & v=-\\frac{1}{\\pi }\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi x).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the integration by parts formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int 4x\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi x)\\,\\text{d}x & =4x\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{\\pi }\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi x))-\\int (-\\frac{1}{\\pi }\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi x))\\cdot 4\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we evaluate the integral and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}4x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi x)\\,\\text{d}x & =-\\frac{4}{\\pi }x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi x)\\,{|}_{0}^{1}+\\frac{4}{\\pi }{\\int }_{0}^{1}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\frac{4}{\\pi }x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi x)\\,{|}_{0}^{1}+\\frac{4}{{\\pi }^{2}}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi x)\\,{|}_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =-\\frac{4}{\\pi }(1\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi \\cdot 1)-0\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi \\cdot 0))+\\frac{4}{{\\pi }^{2}}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi \\cdot 1)-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi \\cdot 0)) \\\\  & =-\\frac{4}{\\pi }(-1-0)+\\frac{4}{{\\pi }^{2}}(0-0) \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{\\pi }.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031626/state.json" "file_sha256" "b044ff58ae98c114d47f0e472cfd823b5642a7c1ef80f958de299959df55c3ca"} {"question" "q-349231" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031626/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "640ecc0f815d7582c1b911b92d4daaa1f3b664c6db18b53fa8ca347a8dcad340"} {"question" "q-349231" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031626/state.json" "file_sha256" "b044ff58ae98c114d47f0e472cfd823b5642a7c1ef80f958de299959df55c3ca"} {"question" "q-349231" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{4}{\\pi}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14031626/state.json" "file_sha256" "b044ff58ae98c114d47f0e